// Boundary notes: donor 4424-4428 complete the `boundary.q2` selected-weapon
// frame assignment C5's range opens, so C5 owns that statement whole; the C6
// step tail (`step_frame_tail`) enters at donor 4429. Donor 4922-4925 (the
